(text "ASSEMBLY / SAFETY\nProtected 1S 4.2 V LiPo only; JST pin 1 = positive. No 2S or LiFePO4.\nBattery temperature contact TH1 must touch the pack through an electrically insulating thermal pad.\nFit a 2.4 GHz 50-ohm U.FL antenna; do not transmit without it. Keep antenna clear of cell and copper.\nDouble-sided JLCPCB Standard assembly; verify pin-1 orientations in the assembly preview.\nNo substitution of LED revision, charger, current-limiter suffix or microphone without review.\nVoice control requires firmware; neither speech models nor games run in a blank module.\nThis is a new prototype design, not a physically validated product." (at 207 224 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3))) (uuid eabde84e-ff71-5aec-b85b-5b46e480c1f3))
